sol1:x=coeff*log(coeff_x*y+const);
sol2:x/coeff_log=log(coeff_x*y+const);/*introduce exponential*/
sol3:%e^(x/coeff_log)=coeff_x*y+const;
sol4:(%e^(x/coeff_log)-const)/coeff_x;/*finding y*/</text>
